槍の名手。古来より武具を管理する物部宗家の長女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天然で無駄に明るく、体を動かすのが得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強と難しい話は、拒絶反応で眠くなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「金月一貫流・物部　巴……参るっ!!! 」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55082"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98a7687f23c418bb582cf839f0beace2c151622fee8d86bd548dfc72e77e57c9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34cb0783acb4c091694ee74d7fb07dc122f785ac66511370ed27d84f32e5e39b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小倉結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:16384:55082:5936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c59740","characterName":"ライラ・リア・ソレル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55083","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"16384"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14784"],"vndbCharacterId":"c59740"},"originalCharacterName":"ライラ・リア・ソレル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【復讐に生きる悪魔のごとき悪魔祓い】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会から派遣されたフランス人のエクソシスト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フランクで人当たりがいいが、たまに問題が起きると人のせいにするクセがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大富豪ソレル家の娘なのだが、血なまぐさい夜の世界に生きる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回来日した真の目的は、仇敵の追跡らしい……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お前は、存在そのものが世界への冒涜よ!! 」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14784","sourceWorkId":"12832","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会から派遣されたフランス人エクソシスト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フランクで友好的。プロ級のライダーで黒ビール好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"復讐のために来日し、仇敵を追っているようだが……"},{"spoile